#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:1
msgid "How filings build on earlier ones"
msgstr "Com les presentacions es basen en les anteriors"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:3
msgid ""
"This page covers the connections between filings: why a yearly summary "
"needs the quarters that came before it, how the tool carries figures "
"forward from your earlier filings, and - just as important - what it "
"leaves for you to check. It is for anyone preparing a form that depends "
"on earlier periods or on the whole year."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta pàgina tracta les connexions entre presentacions: per què un "
"resum anual necessita els trimestres que el van precedir, com l'eina "
"arrossega xifres cap endavant des de les teves presentacions anteriors i,"
" igual d'important, què et deixa a tu per comprovar. És per a qualsevol "
"persona que prepara un model que depèn de períodes anteriors o de tot "
"l'any."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:9
msgid ""
"If you want how a single period's figures are built from your records, "
"see [How your records become tax figures](from-records-to-figures.md). "
"This page is about the connections *between* filings."
msgstr ""
"Si vols saber com es construeixen les xifres d'un sol període a partir "
"dels teus registres, consulta [Com els teus registres es converteixen en "
"xifres tributàries](from-records-to-figures.md). Aquesta pàgina tracta de"
" les connexions *entre* presentacions."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For any term you are unsure of - {term}`modelo 100`, {term}`casilla`, "
"{term}`AEAT receipt <justificante>`, {term}`AEAT`, VAT, IRPF, or RENTA - "
"look it up in the {doc}`glossary </_generated/glossary>`."
msgstr ""
"Per a qualsevol terme de què no estiguis segur ({term}`modelo 100`, "
"{term}`casilla`, {term}`justificant de l'AEAT <justificante>`, "
"{term}`AEAT`, IVA, IRPF o RENDA), cerca'l al {doc}`glossari "
"</_generated/glossary>`."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:13
msgid "Why a later form needs earlier figures"
msgstr "Per què un model posterior necessita xifres anteriors"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:15
msgid ""
"Tax doesn't reset every quarter. The figures you report in one period "
"often feed the next."
msgstr ""
"Els impostos no es reinicien cada trimestre. Les xifres que declares en "
"un període sovint alimenten el següent."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:17
msgid "Two common shapes show up across the forms:"
msgstr "A través dels models apareixen dues formes habituals:"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:19
msgid ""
"**Annual summaries gather the year.** A yearly form rolls up the periods "
"inside it. Modelo 390, for example, summarises the year's Modelo 303 VAT "
"filings. Modelo 100 (RENTA) pulls together the income-tax instalments and"
" withholdings you reported through the year."
msgstr ""
"**Els resums anuals recullen l'any.** Un model anual agrega els períodes "
"que conté. El Modelo 390, per exemple, resumeix les presentacions d'IVA "
"del Modelo 303 de l'any. El Modelo 100 (RENTA) reuneix els pagaments "
"fraccionats i les retencions d'IRPF que has declarat al llarg de l'any."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:20
msgid ""
"**Unused amounts carry into the next period.** If a Modelo 303 quarter "
"leaves you with more VAT paid than collected, the difference becomes an "
"unused amount carried into a later period - a VAT credit you keep until a"
" later return uses it or the legal carry window closes."
msgstr ""
"**Els imports no utilitzats s'arrosseguen al període següent.** Si un "
"trimestre del Modelo 303 et deixa amb més IVA pagat que cobrat, la "
"diferència esdevé un import no utilitzat que s'arrossega a un període "
"posterior: un crèdit d'IVA que conserves fins que una declaració "
"posterior l'utilitza o es tanca el termini legal d'arrossegament."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:22
msgid ""
"In both shapes, the later form can't stand on its own. It reaches back to"
" figures you already reported. The tool carries those figures forward "
"from your earlier filings so you don't re-enter them by hand."
msgstr ""
"En totes dues formes, el model posterior no es pot sostenir per si sol. "
"Es remunta a xifres que ja has declarat. L'eina arrossega aquelles xifres"
" cap endavant des de les teves presentacions anteriors perquè no les "
"hagis de tornar a introduir a mà."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:25
msgid "Earlier figures must be backed by proof"
msgstr "Les xifres anteriors han d'estar avalades per proves"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:27
msgid ""
"A carried-forward figure is only as trustworthy as the filing it came "
"from. So the carry-forward rests on a clear principle. A figure carried "
"in from an earlier filing should come from a filing you actually "
"completed and recorded as filed. Where possible, it should come from one "
"backed by the AEAT receipt."
msgstr ""
"Una xifra arrossegada només és tan fiable com la presentació d'on prové. "
"Per això l'arrossegament es basa en un principi clar. Una xifra portada "
"d'una presentació anterior hauria de provenir d'una presentació que "
"realment has completat i registrat com a presentada. Sempre que sigui "
"possible, hauria de provenir d'una avalada pel justificant de l'AEAT."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:29
msgid ""
"The tool carries forward the figures it *has on record* for the matching "
"modelo, year, and period. It does not invent a prior period that isn't "
"there. If you ask a yearly form to gather four quarters and only two are "
"on record, the tool brings in the two it has - it doesn't fabricate the "
"missing pair to fill the gap. The check then blocks the yearly form until"
" you resolve the gap. That's deliberate. A guessed figure in a filing is "
"worse than a visible blank you can act on."
msgstr ""
"L'eina arrossega cap endavant les xifres que *té registrades* per al "
"model, l'any i el període coincidents. No inventa un període anterior que"
" no hi és. Si demanes a un model anual que reuneixi quatre trimestres i "
"només en té dos registrats, l'eina incorpora els dos que té; no fabrica "
"la parella que falta per omplir el buit. Aleshores la comprovació "
"bloqueja el model anual fins que resolguis el buit. Això és deliberat. "
"Una xifra endevinada en una presentació és pitjor que un buit visible "
"sobre el qual pots actuar."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:31
msgid ""
"Because of this, the figures it carries forward are a starting point you "
"review, not a verdict you accept blindly. You confirm that each earlier "
"figure came from a filing you recorded as filed and that it still "
"reflects what you filed before you rely on it."
msgstr ""
"Per això, les xifres que arrossega cap endavant són un punt de partida "
"que revises, no un veredicte que acceptes a cegues. Confirmes que cada "
"xifra anterior prové d'una presentació que has registrat com a presentada"
" i que encara reflecteix el que vas presentar abans de confiar-hi."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:34
msgid "The running VAT credit balance"
msgstr "El saldo acumulat del crèdit d'IVA"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:36
msgid ""
"The unused-VAT case has its own small piece of memory. When a Modelo 303 "
"period leaves you with VAT credit, the tool keeps a running record of "
"that unused VAT credit to carry forward and brings it into the next "
"period's return."
msgstr ""
"El cas de l'IVA no utilitzat té la seva petita porció de memòria. Quan un"
" període del Modelo 303 et deixa amb crèdit d'IVA, l'eina manté un "
"registre corrent d'aquell crèdit d'IVA no utilitzat per arrossegar cap "
"endavant i l'incorpora a la declaració del període següent."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:38
msgid ""
"That running record needs a true starting point. The first time you use "
"the tool, it has no history of the credit you'd built up before. So you "
"set the opening balance once - the unused VAT credit you were already "
"carrying when you started. From there, each period updates the balance on"
" its own."
msgstr ""
"Aquell registre corrent necessita un punt de partida veritable. El primer"
" cop que utilitzes l'eina, no té cap historial del crèdit que hagis "
"acumulat abans. Per això estableixes el saldo inicial una vegada: el "
"crèdit d'IVA no utilitzat que ja arrossegaves quan vas començar. A partir"
" d'aquí, cada període actualitza el saldo pel seu compte."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:40
msgid ""
"People make mistakes with an opening balance, so there's a correction "
"path. You can fix a wrong opening balance after the fact. One guard "
"protects you: the tool refuses to change the basis of a period you've "
"already recorded as filed. Rewriting a figure that a filed return already"
" relied on would quietly change that return after the fact, so the "
"correction is refused and names the filing that's in the way. If you hit "
"that, the figure is locked because a filing already used it - which is "
"exactly when you'd want it locked."
msgstr ""
"La gent comet errors amb un saldo inicial, i per això hi ha un camí de "
"correcció. Pots corregir un saldo inicial erroni a posteriori. Una "
"salvaguarda et protegeix: l'eina es nega a canviar la base d'un període "
"que ja has registrat com a presentat. Reescriure una xifra en què una "
"declaració presentada ja es basava canviaria discretament aquella "
"declaració a posteriori, de manera que la correcció es rebutja i indica "
"la presentació que ho impedeix. Si topes amb això, la xifra està "
"bloquejada perquè una presentació ja la va utilitzar, que és exactament "
"quan voldries que estigués bloquejada."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:42
msgid ""
"To see the figures a calculation is using, read [Review and supply "
"calculation inputs](../how-to/review-calculation-values.md). The whole "
"cycle - seeding the opening balance, a credit quarter, the carry, and the"
" annual summary - is demonstrated live in [The VAT year](../how-to/iva-"
"lifecycle.md); for the yearly VAT summary alone, see [Prepare the annual "
"Modelo 390 VAT summary](../how-to/modelo-390.md)."
msgstr ""
"Per veure les xifres que utilitza un càlcul, llegeix [Revisa i aporta "
"entrades de càlcul](../how-to/review-calculation-values.md). Tot el cicle"
" (establir el saldo inicial, un trimestre amb crèdit, l'arrossegament i "
"el resum anual) es demostra en directe a [L'any de l'IVA](../how-to/iva-"
"lifecycle.md); per al resum anual d'IVA per si sol, consulta [Prepara el "
"resum anual d'IVA del Modelo 390](../how-to/modelo-390.md)."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:44
msgid "The annual income-tax return pulls the year together"
msgstr "La declaració anual de la renda reuneix tot l'any"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:46
msgid ""
"RENTA - the annual income-tax return - is the clearest example of a form "
"that lives on earlier figures. Across the year you report income tax in "
"pieces: instalment returns as you go, and withholdings that others "
"reported on your behalf. None of those is the final word. RENTA gathers "
"them."
msgstr ""
"La RENTA, la declaració anual de l'IRPF, és l'exemple més clar d'un model"
" que viu de xifres anteriors. Al llarg de l'any declares l'impost sobre "
"la renda a trossos: declaracions de pagaments fraccionats a mesura que "
"avances, i retencions que altres han declarat en nom teu. Cap d'aquestes "
"no és l'última paraula. La RENTA les reuneix."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:48
msgid ""
"The yearly return draws on those instalments and withholdings from your "
"earlier filings, sets them against your full-year income, and settles the"
" final income-tax figure - what's still owed, or what comes back to you. "
"The pieces you filed through the year aren't separate events; they're "
"instalments toward one annual settlement, and the annual return is where "
"they meet."
msgstr ""
"La declaració anual es nodreix d'aquells pagaments fraccionats i "
"retencions de les teves presentacions anteriors, els contraposa als teus "
"ingressos de tot l'any i liquida la xifra final de l'impost sobre la "
"renda: el que encara es deu, o el que et retornen. Els trossos que has "
"presentat al llarg de l'any no són esdeveniments separats; són pagaments "
"a compte d'una sola liquidació anual, i la declaració anual és on es "
"troben."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:50
msgid ""
"The same idea governs the figures: RENTA settles on the instalments and "
"withholdings the tool has on record from filings recorded as filed. You "
"review those before trusting the result."
msgstr ""
"La mateixa idea regeix les xifres: la RENDA es liquida sobre els "
"pagaments fraccionats i les retencions que l'eina té registrats de "
"presentacions registrades com a presentades. Els revises abans de confiar"
" en el resultat."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:52
msgid "What the tool checks, and what it leaves to you"
msgstr "Què comprova l'eina, i què et deixa a tu"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:54
msgid ""
"It helps to be precise about the boundary here, because this is where a "
"filing's accuracy is won or lost."
msgstr ""
"Convé ser precís sobre el límit aquí, perquè és on es guanya o es perd "
"l'exactitud d'una presentació."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:56
msgid ""
"The tool finds and carries forward the earlier figures it has on record, "
"matched by modelo, year, and period. That's the limit of what it does on "
"its own. It does not silently treat unconfirmed or out-of-date agency "
"data as final, it does not invent a prior period that isn't on record, "
"and it does not quietly sweep up every figure it can find and assume each"
" one is correct."
msgstr ""
"L'eina troba i arrossega cap endavant les xifres anteriors que té "
"registrades, coincidents per model, any i període. Aquest és el límit del"
" que fa pel seu compte. No tracta silenciosament com a definitives unes "
"dades de l'agència no confirmades o desactualitzades, no inventa un "
"període anterior que no està registrat, i no recull discretament cada "
"xifra que troba donant per fet que cadascuna és correcta."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:58
msgid ""
"What it leaves to you is the judgement: that each carried-forward figure "
"came from a filing you recorded as filed; that it matches the AEAT "
"receipt for that filing where one exists; and that a missing prior period"
" is a real gap to resolve, not a zero the tool filled for you."
msgstr ""
"El que et deixa a tu és el criteri: que cada xifra arrossegada prové "
"d'una presentació que has registrat com a presentada; que coincideix amb "
"el justificant de l'AEAT d'aquella presentació allà on n'existeix un; i "
"que un període anterior que falta és un buit real per resoldre, no un "
"zero que l'eina t'ha omplert."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:60
msgid ""
"This division is the point. The tool removes the re-typing and the "
"arithmetic; you keep the confirmation. A figure that flows from a quarter"
" into a yearly summary, or from this period's credit into the next, is "
"only as sound as your review of where it came from."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta divisió és el sentit. L'eina elimina la reescriptura i "
"l'aritmètica; tu conserves la confirmació. Una xifra que flueix d'un "
"trimestre a un resum anual, o del crèdit d'aquest període al següent, "
"només és tan sòlida com la teva revisió d'on va sortir."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:62
msgid "Where this sits in the journey"
msgstr "On se situa això dins del recorregut"

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:64
msgid ""
"This page covered the connections between filings - why later forms "
"depend on earlier ones and how figures carry forward. The [how-it-works "
"overview](index.md) maps where this fits among the other concepts. To go "
"a level down into how a single period's figures are built from your "
"records, read [How your records become tax figures](from-records-to-"
"figures.md)."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta pàgina ha tractat les connexions entre presentacions: per què els"
" models posteriors depenen dels anteriors i com les xifres s'arrosseguen "
"cap endavant. La [visió general del funcionament](index.md) mostra on "
"encaixa això entre els altres conceptes. Per baixar un nivell cap a com "
"es construeixen les xifres d'un sol període a partir dels teus registres,"
" llegeix [Com els teus registres es converteixen en xifres tributàries"
"](from-records-to-figures.md)."

#: ../../explanation/building-on-earlier-filings.md:66
msgid ""
"Once your figures are settled - including the ones carried in from "
"earlier filings - the next concept is checking and sharing them. Continue"
" with [Reviewing your numbers and producing the export file](reviewing-"
"and-exporting.md)."
msgstr ""
"Quan les teves xifres estan tancades, incloses les que arrossegues de "
"presentacions anteriors, el concepte següent és comprovar-les i "
"compartir-les. Continua amb [Revisar els teus números i produir el fitxer"
" d'exportació](reviewing-and-exporting.md)."

